              "type": "text-hero",
              "position": 0,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Discover Your Glow</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Welcome to beauty—your home for premium skincare, makeup, and beauty essentials for every skin type and style.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Simple Beauty Text Block</h2><p>This basic text block is ideal for sharing tips, highlighting new products, or outlining skincare routines. Use HTML formatting to enhance your content with lists, headings, bold highlights, and links to your favorite items.</p><ul><li>Showcase product benefits with HTML formatting</li><li>Perfect for ingredient lists or routine steps</li><li>Flexible for any beauty content</li></ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-teaser",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Beauty Highlight Teaser</h2><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>Ideal for introducing collections, spotlighting bestsellers, or sharing skincare wisdom</i></p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Skincare Solutions</h3><p>Use this column to compare different moisturizers, feature before &amp; after results, or organize details about our gentle, effective formulas side by side.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Makeup &amp; More</h3><p>Highlight trending makeup must-haves or seasonal beauty kits. On mobile devices, each column stacks for easy browsing and finding your new favorites.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
