    {
      "name": "Testing Overview",
      "processor": "cms-testing",
      "sections": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text-hero",
              "position": 0,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Beauty Testing Zone</h1><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.2em; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Explore our Testing Overview to discover how different beauty products and site features work together. Experience real CMS elements and shop premium beauty essentials in action.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Beauty Display Features</h2><p>Discover how we showcase our skincare and makeup collections using these CMS elements. Each example below mirrors what you'll find in our beauty store experience:</p><ul><li><strong>Text</strong> – Inspiring beauty tips, banners, and glow-getter highlights</li><li><strong>Images</strong> – Lush galleries, product close-ups, and lookbooks</li><li><strong>Video</strong> – Tutorials and product demonstrations</li><li><strong>Text & Images</strong> – Editorial layouts blending advice with visuals</li><li><strong>Commerce</strong> – Featured product cards, trending picks, and instant add-to-cart sections</li><li><strong>Form</strong> – Beauty quiz, newsletter, and feedback forms</li></ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Beauty Product Formats</h2><p>See how our premium beauty essentials are organized online:</p><ul><li><strong>Simple Product</strong> – Individual items like moisturizers or lipsticks</li><li><strong>Variant Product</strong> – Products available in multiple shades or formulas</li><li><strong>Digital Product</strong> – Downloadable beauty guides and e-books</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 16px; color: #666;\">Use the navigation to experience these product types up close.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
